EncounterFOE:
EVBIT_MODIFY 3
SystemText(FOEWarning)
IfNoSelectedGoto(0x1)
BeginCombatEncounter
LOAD3 0x0 EncounterFOEUnits; ENUN
LoadUnitsByDifficulty(EncounterFOEEnemies,EncounterFOEEnemies,EncounterFOEEnemies)
CreateArenaSingleCorner(11,5)
FADU 16
MUSC Song_IsThatBloodThine
SetMapBGM(Song_IsThatBloodThine)
GOTO 0x2
LABEL 0x1
FADI 16; InitializeNathan(8,5); FADU 16
ENUF WastesEncounterFlag7
LABEL 0x2
EndEvent


EndingScene:
SystemText(NextFloorOneWay)
IfNoSelectedGoto(0x1)
ResetWastesFloorSwapFlags
ResetWastesProgressFlags
MNC3 Stratum3F3
GOTO 0x2
LABEL 0x1
FADI 16; InitializeNathan(2,2); FADU 16
LABEL 0x2
EndEvent


